OL,3,ANot just 'Nice Guy Eddie': Lib Dems
OL,4,Aeager for leader to show radical side
OL,5,Aat party conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FDiscontent bubbles not far from the
OL,8,Fsurface as the Liberal Democrats gather
OL,9,Ffor their conference this weekend.
OL,11,FTwo years on from their best ever
OL,12,Fgeneral election result, conversations
OL,13,Fwith those on the party's frontbench,
OL,14,Fits MPs, and backroom staff reveal a
OL,15,Ffrustration at what many see as a
OL,16,Ffailure to capitalise on that success.
OL,18,FPolling by YouGov in the build up to
OL,19,Fthe conference highlighted the Lib Dems
OL,20,F"have seen no real growth in support
OL,21,Fsince the last general election" and if
OL,22,Fanything have slipped back.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
